; An ordinary signed zone, signed with an ED25519 key -- that being the
; only key it has, and so the only algorithm anything in it can have
; been signed with.
;
; fake.example. is not in it.  www.example. is, and is signed properly.
; The signatures which name algorithm 8 arrive from outside.
$ORIGIN example.
$TTL 3600
@	IN	SOA	ns.example. root.example. 1 3600 900 604800 3600
@	IN	NS	ns.example.
ns	IN	{{AUTH_ADDR_RR}}
www	IN	A	192.0.2.1
